note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note The epilogue of one tile row (or, when no element is recomputed, of adjacent rows packed as one; every element is
note independent) of the general GEMM (CUDApp#144, src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c l.428-439, store_c):
note v = alpha * a (a = 0 + P for one k part, else the k-part sum; the host recompute where flagged), plus beta * C
note when beta != 0 (a NaN beta counts), stored as f32, or RNE bf16 / f16 through the f64 to f32 round to odd.
note q: 0 nc (<= 4096), 1 c_type, 2 compute, 3 one part, 4 alpha f64 bits, 5 beta f64 bits. c holds the nc stored C
note elements of the row as halfwords (the C shell copies them in and out): one per bf16 / f16 element, the low then
note the high half of each f32 element; pv the nc P bits (binary32). Gives the elements recomputed (host_fixed).
note The q words are read once, into scalars: a store into the view c may alias q, so a q read inside the element
note loop would be read again after every store.

note ms: bits 0-1 the c_type, bit 2 compute, bit 3 k-part sums (clear: one k part).
note the compute part of element j before alpha (called only with bit 2 set). For one k part a = 0 + P: that add gives
note P itself except -0 + 0 = +0 (IEEE 754 6.3, round to nearest; a NaN P stays the same quiet NaN), so the P bits
note 80000000 (2147483648) become 0 instead.
fn gx_ea pv view uint 16384 acc view ulong 4096 fix view ulong 4096 bad view uchar 4096 j ulong ms ulong to f64
a = bitcast f64 get acc j
if eq and ms 8 0
p = get pv j
if eq p uint 2147483648
p = uint 0
end
a = f64 bitcast f32 p
end
if ne get bad j 0
a = bitcast f64 get fix j
end
ret a
end

note the beta term and the store of element j as c_type (ms bits 0-1)
fn gx_eb c edit ushort 32768 j ulong ms ulong bt f64 v f64 to void
ct = and ms 3
k = add j j
if ne bt bitcast f64 ulong 0
if eq ct 0
u = shl uint get c add k 1 16
v = add v mul bt f64 bitcast f32 or u uint get c k
else
v = add v mul bt f64 gx_ldf ct uint get c j
end
end
u = bitcast uint f32 v
if eq ct 0
put c k ushort and u 65535
put c add k 1 ushort shr u 16
else
u = bitcast uint gx_d2fo v
if eq ct 1
u = gx_f2bf u
else
u = gx_f2h u
end
put c j ushort u
end
end

fn gemm_ex_epi q view ulong 8 pv view uint 16384 acc view ulong 4096 fix view ulong 4096 bad view uchar 4096 c edit ushort 32768 to ulong
ms = get q 1
if ne get q 2 0
ms = or ms 12
if ne get q 3 0
ms = xor ms 8
end
end
al = bitcast f64 get q 4
bt = bitcast f64 get q 5
n = ulong 0
for j ulong get q 0
if gt ms 3
gx_eb edit c j ms bt mul al gx_ea view pv view acc view fix view bad j ms
if ne get bad j 0
n = add n 1
end
else
gx_eb edit c j ms bt bitcast f64 ulong 0
end
end
ret n
end
